{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"093ffba2-6edb-4765-858c-63a1d999eb16","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The intended behavior for the failing test case has been analyzed and documented in [`summary.txt`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/jacksonxml_5_group_b_arch/summary.txt) in the project root directory.\n\n### Summary of Documented Requirements\n\n* **Copy Independence**: Creating a copy of an [`XmlMapper`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/jacksonxml_5_group_b_arch/src/main/java/com/fasterxml/jackson/dataformat/xml/XmlMapper.java) using `copy()` must yield an independent mapper instance whose subsequent configuration changes do not affect or depend on the original instance.\n* **Root Name Resolution with Annotations Enabled**: When an [`XmlMapper`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/jacksonxml_5_group_b_arch/src/main/java/com/fasterxml/jackson/dataformat/xml/XmlMapper.java) with annotation processing enabled serializes an object annotated with `@JacksonXmlRootElement(localName = \"...\")`, it must serialize using the annotated local name as the XML root element name.\n* **Root Name Resolution with Annotations Disabled on a Copied Mapper**: When a copied [`XmlMapper`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/jacksonxml_5_group_b_arch/src/main/java/com/fasterxml/jackson/dataformat/xml/XmlMapper.java) has annotation processing disabled, serializing an annotated object must disregard `@JacksonXmlRootElement` and fall back to using the simple class name as the XML root element name.\n* **Order Independence**: Root name resolution must be determined independently per mapper instance and must not be altered by whichever mapper instance executes serialization first.\n","duration_seconds":79.362378,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":135066,"output_tokens":11259,"thinking_tokens":8392,"cache_read_tokens":650939,"total_tokens":146325}}}
